      "text": "joosinkw 12/06/24 Let’s explore three popular and versatile Korean expressions today! 1. 꿀맛 (Kkul-mat) Literally, this means \"honey taste,\" but it’s used to describe something extremely delicious or enjoyable. Example: 이 케이크 진짜 꿀맛이야! = \"This cake is absolutely delicious!\" 2. 꿀잼 (Kkul-jaem) This slang term combines \"꿀\" (honey) and \"잼\" (short for 재미, meaning fun). It’s used to say something is super fun or entertaining. Example: 어제 본 영화 꿀잼이었어! = \"The movie I watched yesterday was super fun!\" 15 2 2",
